p, find chests, rest, or risk random events.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Note: Other players are saved data, not live people. Take your time to manage your pack.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3972650/extras/1baf4147dd634387e3211d0023390070.avif?t=1765448999\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But always remember: your goal is to reach Mount Hua\u2019s peak and defeat everyone else.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3972650/extras/4ae649913b2d20636faf7f04b6038c52.avif?t=1765448999\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Spy on Enemies, Prepare to Fight</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >On the map, you can spy on enemy packs. See what items they carry. Learn their strategy and what loot they\u2019ll drop if defeated.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3972650/extras/13d63a892b1980fb223d48076a571821.avif?t=1765448999\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Oh, and when you beat someone, you loot some items from their pack.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3972650/extras/fe5baccd11046d8e698173df4748f455.avif?t=1765448999\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Twelve Sects, Unique Playstyles</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each sect starts with a different pack, items, and location. The shops, chests, events, and enemies you meet also change based on your sect.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Planned sects (may change):</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Shaolin</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Wudang</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Huashan</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Wudu Cult</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tianyin Cult</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Red Blades</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Xuanji Sect</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Changsheng Sect</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Emei Sect</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Liushunmen</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Quanzhen Sect</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Xiayao Palace</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3972650/extras/e2682b1cb2d07baf0caf2962e299efdb.avif?t=1765448999\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","developers":["\u80cc\u5305\u5de5\u4f5c\u5ba4"],"genres":[{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3972650/aaecdf5020693cf52c7f2a6c997970ff2eda4f8a/header.jpg?t=1765448999","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3972650/1577004611/82dbc233bbd6642ddd926fba4dabd4d59a005006/1764325819/dash_av1.mpd?t=1764653851","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3972650/1577004611/82dbc233bbd6642ddd926fba4dabd4d59a005006/1764325819/dash_h264.mpd?t=1764653851","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3972650/1577004611/82dbc233bbd6642ddd926fba4dabd4d59a005006/1764325819/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1764653851","id":257239847,"name":"gameplay cuts","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257239847/fe6d9a273e54bf17d7a60de3c9d0bc241a8b946e/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1764653851"}],"name":"Backpack Jianghu","package_groups":[],"pc